NOTES=[
N('If we had left earlier, we ___ the train.','would have caught','Üçüncü koşul: if + had + V3, would have + V3.',{'would catch': 'would catch ikinci koşul sonucudur; geçmiş koşulda would have + V3 gerekir.', 'would have catched': 'catch düzensiz fiildir; V3 caught olur, catched diye biçim yoktur.'}),
N('If he had worked harder, he ___ the exam.','would have passed','if + had + V3 → would have + V3.',{'would pass': 'Geçmiş koşulun sonucu için would have + V3 gerekir.', 'will have passed': 'will have passed gelecekteki bir geçmişi anlatır; koşul cümlesinde would kullanılır.'}),
N("If they ___ the map, they wouldn't have got lost.",'had checked','if cümlesi: had + V3.',{'checked': 'Üçüncü koşulda if cümlesi had + V3 ister; yalnız Past Simple ikinci koşul olur.', 'would check': 'if cümlesinde would kullanılmaz.'}),
N('If I ___ a bit earlier, I would have seen him.','had arrived','if + had + V3.',{'would arrive': 'if cümlesinde would kullanılmaz.', 'have arrived': 'have arrived tek başına if cümlesinde had olmadan olmaz.'}),
N("If he ___ so fast, he wouldn't have had an accident.","hadn't driven","Olumsuz if cümlesi: hadn't + V3.",{"didn't drive": "didn't drive ikinci koşul biçimidir; geçmişe dönük olamaz.", "wouldn't drive": 'if cümlesinde would kullanılmaz.'}),
N('I ___ you if I had had your number.','would have called','Sonuç cümlesi: would have + V3.',{'would call': 'Geçmiş koşulun sonucu would have + V3 olur.', 'would have call': 'would have + V3 gerekir; call yalın fiildir, called olmalı.'}),
N('She would have called if she ___ your number.','had had','have → had → had; if + had had.',{'has had': "has had Present Perfect'tir; geçmiş koşul için had + V3 gerekir.", 'would have had': 'if cümlesinde would have kullanılmaz.'}),
N("If you ___ the instructions, you wouldn't have made that mistake.",'had read','if + had + V3: had read.',{'would read': 'if cümlesinde would kullanılmaz.', 'have read': 'had yerine have kullanılırsa Present Perfect olur; üçüncü koşulda had gerekir.'}),
N("We wouldn't have been late if the bus ___ on time.",'had arrived','Geçmişe dönük koşul: had + V3.',{'would arrive': 'if cümlesinde would kullanılmaz.', 'arrived': 'arrived ikinci koşul biçimidir; geçmişe dönük pişmanlık için had arrived gerekir.'}),
N('If she ___ the job, she would have moved to Paris.','had accepted','if + had + V3.',{'would accept': 'if cümlesinde would kullanılmaz.', 'has accepted': 'has accepted geçmiş koşul için uygun değildir; had + V3 gerekir.'}),
N("If it hadn't rained, we ___ a picnic.",'would have had','would have + V3: would have had.',{'would had': 'would sonrası had değil have gelir: would have + V3.', 'would had had': 'would sonrası had değil have gelir: would have had.'}),
N('___ you told me, I would have helped.','Had','Resmî devrik koşul: Had + özne + V3.',{'Have': 'Have + özne + V3 geçmiş koşulu kurmaz; devrik koşul Had ile yapılır.', 'Did': 'Did + özne + V3 olmaz; if yerine Had gelir.'}),
N('Hangi cümle doğru?','If I had seen the sign, I would have stopped.','if + had + V3, would have + V3.',{'If I would have seen the sign, I would have stopped.': 'if cümlesinde would have kullanılmaz; had seen olmalı.', 'If I had seen the sign, I would stopped.': 'would sonrası have eksik; would have stopped olmalı.'}),
N('Hangi cümle doğru?','If they had trained harder, they would have won.','Üçüncü koşulun iki parçası: had + V3 / would have + V3.',{'If they would have trained harder, they would have won.': 'if cümlesinde would have kullanılmaz.', 'If they had trained harder, they had won.': 'Ana cümlede had won olmaz; would have won gerekir.'}),
N('Without his advice last year, I ___ the job.',"wouldn't have got","Without + isim = if ... hadn't; sonuç: would have + V3.",{"wouldn't get": "wouldn't get şimdi ya da gelecek içindir; last year geçmiş olduğu için have + V3 gerekir.", "wouldn't have get": 'have sonrası V3 gerekir: got; get yalın fiildir.'}),
N('You ___ the doctor earlier. (aramalıydın)','should have called','Geçmişe eleştiri: should have + V3.',{'should call': 'should call şimdiki öneridir; geçmişteki eksiği anlatmak için should have + V3 gerekir.', 'should have call': 'should have + V3 gerekir; call yalın fiildir, called olmalı.'}),
N('Aynı anlamdaki cümle hangisi? → "I missed the bus because I woke up late."',"If I hadn't woken up late, I wouldn't have missed the bus.","Geçmişin tersi: hadn't + V3, wouldn't have + V3.",{"If I hadn't woken up late, I would have missed the bus.": 'Anlam tersine döner; olumsuz koşulun sonucu da olumsuz olmalı.', "If I didn't wake up late, I wouldn't have missed the bus.": "didn't wake ikinci koşul biçimidir; geçmişi anlatmak için hadn't woken gerekir."}),
N('Aynı anlamdaki cümle hangisi? → Had she known, she would have helped.','If she had known, she would have helped.','Had + özne + V3 = if + had + V3.',{'If she knew, she would have helped.': 'knew ikinci koşuldur; Had she known yapısı had + V3 anlamındadır.', 'If she has known, she would have helped.': "has known Present Perfect'tir; geçmiş koşulda had known gerekir."}),
N('Hangi cümle YANLIŞ?','If he had told me, I would helped him.','would sonrası have + V3 gerekir: would have helped.',{'If she had asked, I would have helped her.': 'Bu cümle doğru: had asked + would have helped.', 'If we had known, we would have waited.': 'Bu cümle doğru: had known + would have waited.'}),
N('If you had told me, I ___ helped you. (belki)','might have','Belirsiz sonuç: might have + V3.',{'might': 'might yalın fiil ister; geçmiş için have + V3 gerekir.', 'might to': 'Modal sonrası to gelmez.'}),
]
